  "project_description": "Buster decorates Drupal's public stream wrapper so that external URLs for public files carry a short content-derived '_buster' query token. When a file's contents change the token changes, forcing CDNs, proxies and browsers to fetch the new version instead of serving a stale cached copy. It requires no configuration, provides no routes or permissions, and simply overrides PublicStream::getExternalUrl().",
